    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107666" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερλάμπ-ω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shine exceeding brightly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				9.20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>surpass in splendour,</i> c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristid.
					<u>Or.</u>
					26(14).84
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>shine over,</i> c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θέατρον
				ὑπερλάμπον τῆς ὅλης</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεως</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Or.</u>
				61.10
			</span></i>.</div>
